# Godot 4+ specific ignores
.godot/
/android/

## .NET (Godot C#)
bin/
obj/
.vs/
*.user
export.cfg

## VS Code
.vscode/

## Godot SDK-bump backups
*.csproj.old

## e2e suite (regenerated on every run)
tests/turning_results.json
tests/run_test_*.log
tests/twoway_repro_*.jsonl

## recordings (run artifacts - never in git; a tape kept to DOCUMENT something
## goes to docs/tapes/ by name, see docs/tapes/README.md and docs/WORKFLOW.md)
tests/tape_T_*.txt

## crash dumps (regenerated on every run)
logs/

## OS / Python tooling junk
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
.venv
   # plain ".venv" too: a symlink named .venv is NOT matched by ".venv/" and got committed once (see git log: fix #39 entry-limit-measured)
TestResults/

# Agent session state (goal files, event ledger). It is this machine\u2019s working
# memory, not project content: a PR must not carry a goal checkpoint, and a
# worktree checkout must not overwrite the live session. Added after PR #51
# shipped four .pi/goals files because scripts/fix.sh checkpoint-commits them.
.pi/
